<http://data.silknow.org/object/a4c6ad9a-ff70-3a78-b200-58889e9fa9ba>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Woven in silks and gilded anilmal membrane wound on a silk core.  Central portion has rows of eight-pointed stars in white within white circles on a bright blue background.  Above this is a narrow border of red in lozenge-shaped weave.  At the bottom, a gold border in the same weave.  Each of these borders is outlined with several very narrow stripes in various colors.  Very worn., probably from the Cathedral of Siguenza."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/a577f93c-57d7-3466-953c-0fdd8eea2121> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/2e31257f-1f04-3e2e-9e77-f8e2814fc7db> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/374babdc-cf24-38b1-b8c1-275800457c38> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Woven in silks and gilded anilmal membrane wound on a silk core.  Central portion has rows of eight-pointed stars in white within white circles on a bright blue background.  Above this is a narrow border of red in lozenge-shaped weave.  At the bottom, a gold border in the same weave.  Each of these borders is outlined with several very narrow stripes in various colors.  Very worn., probably from the Cathedral of Siguenza."@en ;
